      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When you select world there always one public instance selected. Now **Group Public may be selected by default**.\n\nThis is important, as a lot of ppl I know when want to hang out with random people, just clicking world and then \"Join\". Users just not expect to end in managed instances with specific set of rules, or just abusive. They assume the default \"Join\" button will send you to unbiased public space.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
