      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Going back to original topic of this request, I believe and suggested already, world owner must not only be able to hide group publics, but also be able choose what other instance types are allowed at all. On some worlds, any public instances may ruin world experience:  https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/ability-to-disable-public-instances-of-published-world-as-possible-solution-to-i",
      "viewerReactions": null,
