      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's been a year since I explained the problems in the comments below in details, but mostly things are the same, those statements still actual this day.\n\nEven more - it's become more problematic as a lot of trolls aware of those issues and lot of ppl have own groups now.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
